      "certification": "Salesforce Certified Platform App Builder",
      "certification_code": "platform_app_builder",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "chunk_text_excerpt": "Workflow Rules and Processes are older automation tools that are now disabled for creating new automations. Flow Builder's new functionality makes it the main automation tool in Salesforce: its configurable entry conditions allow a flow to run only when certain conditions are met, dramatically improving performance, and flows are easier than workflow rules and processes to maintain, troubleshoot, and debug. The Migrate to Flow tool is available for migrating eligible existing workflow rules and processes to flows.",
